+!> The flag is a RAW PASSTHROUGH to the external xtb, deliberately: g-xTB's
+!> two models are '--gbe <solvent>' and '--cosmo <solvent>' (see the g-xTB
+!> README), neither of which CREST knows anything about.  Validating the
